      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm having one of those crazy migraines again. it hit me super fast, like in like 5 seconds it just went from zero to the worst pain ive ever felt. it's kinda nauseous too. i already have my sumatriptan pills, should i just take one of those and try to sleep it off? i really dont want to go to the er if i can help it",
