    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, i'll try that. just to be sure though, i've been feeling a bit dizzy and my neck feels really stiff too. is it okay if i take a couple of the sumatriptan at once to make sure it works? i really just want this to go away so i can sleep.",
